<title>USA: Selective Insurance names CFO.</title>
<headline>Selective Insurance names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BRANCHVILLE, N.J. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Selective Insurance Group Inc said on Monday David Merclean has been named senior vice president and chief financial officer of the company.</p>
<p>Merclean was most recently with Sun Alliance USA as senior vice president and treasurer, Selective said.</p>
<p>The name of Merclean's predecessor was not immediately available.  </p>
<p>Gregory Murphy, the current president and chief operating officer, was the previous chief financial officer.</p>
